Opposed calls to change the  [LINK: (controversial Redskins branding) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington_Redskins_name_controversy]  until 2020 amid growing pressure from sponsors, with the franchise playing as the Washington Football Team before its renaming as the Commanders in  [LINK: (2022) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Washington_Commanders_season] . Was represented by his wife  [LINK: (Tanya) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tanya_Snyder]  at NFL events after he was indefinitely suspended by the league in 2021.

