The Command Force is the team's professional dance and performance group. They were formed in 1962 as a  [LINK: (cheerleading) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheerleading]  squad called the Redskinettes, [LINK: ([231]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington_Commanders#cite_note-232]  then renamed the Command Force upon the team's rebranding as the Commanders in 2022. [LINK: ([232]) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington_Commanders#cite_note-233]  As cheerleaders, they were sometimes referred to as the First Ladies of Football.


